{"id":"n-20261021-osprs2","category":"travel","display_title":"Best European Spots for Autumn Sun","display_title_he":"המקומות הטובים באירופה לשמש של סתיו","short_summary":"Discover four fantastic destinations in Europe and Turkey where visitors can enjoy warm autumn weather, fewer crowds, and rich local culture.","english_level":"C1","words":464,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/2019_European_Best_Sniper_Team_Competition_-_German_sniper.webp/960px-2019_European_Best_Sniper_Team_Competition_-_German_sniper.webp?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Gertrud Zach · Public domain","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2019_European_Best_Sniper_Team_Competition_-_German_sniper.webp"},"sources":[{"name":"The Guardian","domain":"theguardian.com","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/travel/2026/oct/18/five-best-places-for-autumn-sun-europe-turkey","title":"‘We hang on to summer a little longer here’: five of the best places for autumn sun in Europe and Turkey","published_at":"2026-10-18T06:00:52.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:00:52.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-21T06:20:49.337Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["As summer fades across much of Europe, several destinations maintain a vibrant yet relaxed atmosphere, offering travelers a splendid chance to extend their warm-weather getaways. In Turkey, the coastal resort of Kalkan remains lively in October, contrasting sharply with other regional destinations that grow quiet and melancholic at the end of the season. Visitors can watch transcendentally lovely apricot-rose sunsets over the horseshoe-shaped bay, enjoy bustling harbourfront restaurants where day gulets still putter in and out, and easily secure transport without waiting an hour for a taxi. The glittering beach at Kaputas becomes far less crowded than during the peak summer months, providing plenty of space for a dip. Meanwhile, the nearby mountain village of Bezirgan offers complete peace alongside traditional local food like manti and kofte along the Lycian Way, accompanied by the sounds of woodpeckers battering almond trees and squirrels skittering through leaves.","Further west along Spain's wild Costa de Almería, the fishing village of Agua Amarga provides a stylish yet low-key retreat for late-season travelers. Situated on a crescent-shaped bay, the village features narrow whitewashed streets, a lush palm grove, and splashes of pink bougainvillaea, alongside traditional beach bars like Los Tarahis serving dishes such as arroz negro con bogavante with your toes in the sand. Unlike the heavily developed costas to the north and west, Agua Amarga offers a calm environment for hiking through coastal coves and exploring the arid landscapes of the Cabo de Gata nature reserve, with its winding dry riverbeds and abandoned goldmines. The area is also famous among cinephiles for its rich cinematic history, having served as a backdrop for classic westerns and British gangster films like Sexy Beast.","In Portugal, Cascais transitions smoothly into autumn as municipal workers tend to green spaces and floral displays along the promenade. Located a short train ride from Lisbon, this former royal retreat retains plenty of energy while avoiding the intense crowds of the summer months. Visitors can explore local cultural attractions such as the pyramid-shaped Casa das Histórias Paula Rego, rent bicycles to ride along the craggy coastline towards Praia do Guincho, or take a short bus trip to discover the palaces and forested mountains of Sintra. For those looking at the far western tip of mainland Europe, Cabo da Roca offers some of the latest autumn sunsets on the continent.","Finally, the Italian town of Senigallia in the Marche region offers an alluring alternative to crowded summer beach clubs. Known for its miles of fine sand called Velvet Beach, the town becomes particularly rewarding during the autumn months. Beyond the coastline, Senigallia holds a reputation as a five-star culinary destination, boasting multiple Michelin stars across top restaurants like Uliassi and Madonnina del Pescatore, where talented locally born chefs draw food lovers from far and wide."],"facts":[{"fact":"Kalkan offers autumn sun with vibrant sunsets, active harbourfront restaurants, and nearby spots like Kaputas beach and Bezirgan village.","sources":[1]},"Agua Amarga on Spain's Costa de Almería provides a low-key fishing village atmosphere with warm autumn seas and hiking trails.","Cascais in Portugal features floral promenades, cultural sites like Casa das Histórias Paula Rego, and proximity to Sintra.","Senigallia in Italy features Velvet Beach and high-end dining, including Michelin-starred restaurants Uliassi and Madonnina del Pescatore."],"glossary":[{"text":"As","lemma":"as","pos":"ADP","he":"כאשר","name":false},{"text":"summer","lemma":"summer","pos":"NOUN","he":"קיץ","name":false},{"text":"fades","lemma":"fade","pos":"VERB","he":"דועך","name":false},{"text":"across","lemma":"across","pos":"ADP","he":"ברחבי","name":false},{"text":"much","lemma":"much","pos":"ADJ","he":"רוב","name":false},{"text":"Europe","lemma":"Europe","pos":"PROPN","he":"אירופה","name":true},{"text":"several","lemma":"several","pos":"ADJ","he":"מספר","name":false},{"text":"destinations","lemma":"destination","pos":"NOUN","he":"יעדים","name":false},{"text":"maintain","lemma":"maintain","pos":"VERB","he":"שומרים על","name":false},{"text":"vibrant","lemma":"vibrant","pos":"ADJ","he":"תוסס","name":false},{"text":"yet","lemma":"yet","pos":"ADV","he":"אך","name":false},{"text":"relaxed","lemma":"relaxed","pos":"ADJ","he":"רגוע","name":false},{"text":"atmosphere","lemma":"atmosphere","pos":"NOUN","he":"אוירה","name":false},{"text":"offering","lemma":"offer","pos":"VERB","he":"מציעים","name":false},{"text":"travelers","lemma":"traveler"